  "changelog": {
    "1.9 (2026-10-30)": [
      "Head v6: footsteps, clapping, laughter, cat, rain trained in the head (source yamnet+train). Head = 15 sounds.",
      "New suppress rules (mapping): traffic by Rain / Raindrop / Rain on surface; knock by Walk, footsteps; explosion by Clapping / Applause.",
      "Reason: final test round 1 (log 6.8): rain fired traffic, footsteps fired knock, clapping fired explosion."
    ],
    "1.8 (2026-10-30)": [
      "After the final test round 1 (log 6.8): laughter fired crowd in test_final. New priority rule: crowd is hidden when laughter fires.",
      "footsteps kept (team decision). footsteps / clapping / laughter become hard negatives in head training v5. No threshold or mapping changed."
    ],
    "1.7 (2026-10-30)": [
      "Removed train (team decision 2026-10-30): it overlapped with traffic (train fired traffic in 16/16 ESC-50 clips). 27 -> 26 sounds (25 R1 + adhan R2).",
      "priority: traffic is now hidden only by skid. Driving mode: critical + horn + skid.",
      "test_final/train clips moved to test_final/other as negatives (except 854368, which has scooters = traffic)."
    ],
    "1.6 (2026-10-30)": [
      "Removed insects (team decision 2026-10-30): 28 -> 27 sounds (26 R1 + adhan R2). Nothing else changed."
    ],
    "1.5 (2026-10-30)": [
      "After step 2c (all 28 sounds tested). Team decision 2026-10-30.",
      "New 'priority' display rule: alarm is hidden when fire_alarm or emergency_siren fires; traffic is hidden when train or skid fires (fire_alarm came with alarm in 8/8 clips, emergency_siren with alarm in 4/5, train with traffic in 16/16, skid with traffic in 3/3).",
      "traffic and keys added to the head training list (source yamnet+train): traffic fired on microwave/kettle/blender/drill/printer, keys on dishes/cutlery/hammer.",
      "Data fix: 31057 (rubbish truck), 398859 (truck), 804483 (truck reversing) moved from other to traffic: they contain trucks, so the traffic alert on them was correct.",
      "No threshold or mapping changed."
    ],
    "1.4 (2026-10-30)": [
      "Scope reduction (team decision 2026-10-30): 53 -> 28 sounds (27 R1 + adhan R2), 8 categories. Sounds may be added back later if accuracy is good.",
      "Deleted: door_window, cough, whistling, device_beep, glass_break, water_running, boiling, microwave, vacuum, blender, frying, dishes, printer, power_tool, hammer, saw, reversing, crash, car_alarm, aircraft, wind. Their recordings moved to data 'other' as negatives.",
      "speech merged into crowd ('ضجة ناس / كلام'): crowd now maps Speech, Conversation, Child speech too. Speech/radio/TV/recitation/nasheed files moved from other to crowd; recitation & nasheeds stay adhan negatives (crowd/_notes_crowd.txt).",
      "phone_ring + alarm_clock merged into phone_tone. motorcycle + truck_bus + car_passing merged into traffic (Car, Vehicle, Motor vehicle (road), Traffic noise removed from ignore_yamnet; Air brake added).",
      "bell threshold 0.85 -> 0.125 (tuned on half the bell groups, step 4). bell suppressed by Ringtone / Telephone bell ringing too (step 4b).",
      "Kept step-4b candidate additions for surviving sounds: keys += Chink, clink. (Heavy engine (low frequency) is not a YAMNet class, so not added.) Candidate changes for deleted sounds dropped.",
      "Categories: devices+home+work -> home_devices; road trimmed. Driving mode excludes traffic (always present while driving).",
      "source 'yamnet+train' = planned FSD50K/our-data head training (bell, knock, scream, alarm, explosion, crowd, phone_tone, washing_machine). phone_tone and traffic thresholds are defaults (0.5) until tested."
    ],
    "1.3 (2026-10-28)": [
      "Removed quran (team decision 2026-10-23). 53 sounds: 52 R1 + adhan R2.",
      "bell = any bell (doorbell, intercom, school, reception/service, bicycle, hand bell) EXCEPT church/tower bells (team decision 2026-10-28).",
      "bell mapping: removed Church bell, Jingle bell, Tubular bells; added Bicycle bell.",
      "suppress bell when Church bell / Change ringing (campanology) is present.",
      "bell threshold 0.85 was tuned on ESC-50 church bells: must be re-tuned on our recordings in step 4.",
      "Notebooks must assert every YAMNet class name here exists in yamnet_class_map.csv (Bicycle bell, Change ringing (campanology) not yet verified)."
    ]
  },
